.SH "نام (NAME)"
extractrc \- Extract message strings from UI and GUI\-RC files
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.HP \w'\fBextractrc\fR\ 'u
\fBextractrc\fR [\fB\fIfilename\fR\fR]
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.PP
\fBextractrc\fR
finds all text tags and other message strings in the given files and writes the corresponding i18n() calls to standard output so that xgettext can parse them\&.
.PP
It understands both (Qt(TM)/KDE)
designer\*(Aqs
UI
files and
XML
GUI\-RC files\&.
.PP
This utility is part of the KDE Software Development Kit\&.
.SH "نویسنده (AUTHOR)"
.PP
\fBBen Burton\fR <\&bab@debian\&.org\&>
